+# Audio application probes do not complete conversational audio
+
+[project-postulate] Brandon's direct follow-up to `af2bb8fe` corrects the claimed Apple/audio
+completion: audio data based on conversations and English communication is required. A handful
+of personal microphone samples cannot supply that work. The earlier instruction to procure
+curated WAVs selected a data source; it did not reduce the product objective to file playback,
+small signal controls or serial byte exposure. No microphone recording is a prerequisite for
+corpus preparation, native audio development, useful recognition/synthesis or real-time processing.
+
+## What stands
+
+[established-bounded; implemented-exact, measured] AS1–AS3 retain the verified local rational
+phase realization on Apple Metal: allocation/ownership, exact device formation/circulation/rechart,
+public continuation, refusal and measured costs. This is the existing phase-family foundation,
+not a port of every Holonics native owner. The
+[implementation record](2026-09-06_APPLE_NATIVE_PHASE_AND_ACOUSTIC_COMPOSITION.md) retains its
+actual engine, public-session and process checks; Linux/CUDA execution was not rerun on the Mac.
+
+[established-bounded; source-inspected, measured] AS4–AS5 returned application probes and audio
+apparatus. `acoustic-seed.json` specifies two equal-admittance junctions and fixed transports.
+`AcousticApplication::current_for` maps each PCM codeword to a rational real coordinate and may
+add the declared one-sample feedback. `SpeechExposureApplication::advance_one` completes the
+WAV before receiving transcript bytes through that same digital circuit. Its phase rank and
+plural receiver results are genuine algebraic consequences of this specimen, not a measure of
+speech or conversational competence. `NativeAcousticPotentialComplex` makes the emitted current
+audible under a fixed spectral receiver; that is sonification, not learned speech synthesis.
+
+[established-bounded; source-inspected] The application entry points found a fresh native session
+from the seed. `AcousticApplication::found` requires an untouched seed, while its checkpoint
+resume finishes the retained occurrence. `SpeechExposureApplication` similarly owns one WAV
+and one transcript and stops when both finish. The native session can continue receiving, but
+these corpus-facing applications do not yet mount successive new utterances/turns into a
+continuing cultivated model. This is a concrete missing application composition, not a need
+for microphone access or another learning engine.
+
+[established-bounded; measured] Downloaded data comprise 2,000 ESC-50 environmental sound WAVs
+and a 100-clip LibriSpeech dev-clean subset. Actual native experiments used one complete ESC-50
+clip, quarter-second chronology/polarity controls from three sources, and one complete LibriSpeech
+utterance with linked/unlinked comparisons. Downloading the full collections did not cultivate
+them. Read speech and environmental clips also do not supply the conversational turn structure
+needed for the intended English communication work.
+
+[established-bounded; measured, source-inspected] The five-second ESC-50 continuation took
+299.47 s including cold publication during other work, with a 465,125,473-byte checkpoint. The
+current Metal phase dispatch uses one device thread per dependent operation; the application
+performs a receive per PCM sample with terminal synchronization/readout and retains per-sample
+history. These facts identify execution/storage work to investigate. They do not establish
+an irreducible lower bound for HNA or Apple hardware. A release build alone has not been shown
+to close this gap.
+
+## Corrected construction position
+
+[historical] The statement in `af2bb8fe` that AS1–AS5 were complete at experimental scopes is
+withdrawn as completion of Brandon's request. Narrowing completion to a checkpoint/sonification
+probe did not discharge the intended acoustic and English communication work. The source,
+measurements, input lineage and successful lifecycle checks remain available at their actual scopes.
+
+[open] AS4 remains partial: compose corpus-backed acoustic material, continuing native development
+across distinct recordings and usable perception/production through the existing owners. The
+probe's one-sample codeword circuit and fixed sonification are insufficient evidence of that return.
+AS5 remains open: compose English speech and conversational turns with their actual source,
+speaker, temporal and response relationships; develop/read the native audio/language conduct,
+produce usable communication and measure streaming behavior. Mere adjacency of a WAV and its
+transcript is not a learned acoustic/language relation.
+
+[definition] Continue with appropriately broad recorded English and conversational audio,
+retaining available transcripts, speakers, turns and timing as source-qualified observations.
+Use source annotations in their declared exterior jurisdiction; do not replace native topology
+or learning with expected-answer routing, a fixed classifier or transcript-selected emission.
+Demonstrate the relevant recognition, generation and later-turn behavior on material not used
+to create that behavior when making a generalization claim. Personal voice samples may later
+support optional voice adaptation or device/room checks; they do not establish general capability.
+
+[definition] Real-time execution can be developed and tested with timestamped recorded streams.
+Work on residency, submission/synchronization overhead, durable source/history representation,
+pending input/output and actual latency/throughput must preserve the same complete native
+successor and its causal dependencies. A buffer boundary does not become semantic identity.
+Microphone/room calibration applies only to claims about that physical capture/playback path.
+
+[established-bounded; process-audit] This correction inspected the live application, seed, Metal
+submission owner and prior measured artifacts at `af2bb8fe`. It changes specifications and current
+status, not executable conduct. No new training, runtime benchmark or speech capability is claimed
+by this correction; the existing evidence was not rerun merely to restate its scope.
